{"articleNo":"1384","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1384&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★학생의료공제회 제도 및 가입 안내★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.09.08","hit":"9672","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;\n<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #d8d8ff\">학생의료공제회 제도 및 가입 안내</span></div>\n<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">학생이 질병 또는 부상으로 진료를 받은 경우 적절한 진료비를 보전하고, 학생의 보건 향상을 목적으로 한다.<br>(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">★가입여부는 강제가 아닌 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">선택사항</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">입니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">)</span></div>\n<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">1. 가입 방법</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 가입 대상자 </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> 2010학년도 2학기 대학 신입생, 재입학생, 편입학생&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 2010학년도 2학기 대학원 신입생</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">○ 건축학전공(5학년)자 중 의료공제회원<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 의료공제회원 중 학기(8학기)초과자</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">나. 가입 기간 : 2010</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">. 9. 9.(목) ~ 2010. 9. 30.(목)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 가입 금액 </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 대학 신입생 : 5,000원× 8학기 + 2,000원(가입비)= 42,000원</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 편입학생 및 재입학생 : 학기당 5,000원 + 2,000원(가입비)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 대학원 신입학생 : 5,000원× 4학기 + 2,000원(가입비)= 22,000원</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 건축학전공(5학년) : 5,000원× 2학기= 10,000원</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 학기초과자 : 학기당 5,000원</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">라. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">가입 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">농협중앙회 전국지점<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(교내 농협 수납가능 : 글로벌관 1층 128호)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">★</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FO